{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33959","headline":"奉和鲁望同游北禅院 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望同游北禅院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戚历杉阴入草堂，老僧相见似相忘。\n吟多几转莲花漏，坐久重焚柏子香。\n鱼惯斋时分净食，鸽能闲处傍禅牀。\n云林满眼空羁滞，欲对弥天却自伤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33959.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33959","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}